        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "False recovery?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have no idea what you're trying to say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you really not understand me, or are you just\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine, I'll explain it one more time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The reason I came to the Afterglow was to investigate why the Infected people here were suddenly getting better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But according to our visits over the last few days, the Infected here in the Afterglow are not getting better, but exhibiting something called a 'false recovery.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "In other words, the patient's condition appears to be getting better, but in reality is taking a turn for the worse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_482_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why would they appear to be improving then if they're getting worse?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me explain it another way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Generally speaking, whenever the body is injured, the best outcome is for it to 'return to its original state.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If it is unable to return to its original state, the body will mobilize its non-damaged parts to cover for the functions lost through the injury, a process we call 'compensation.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right now, most of the Infected in the Afterglow have activated their body's compensation functions, causing them to appear to be in very good shape.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But inside them, where the eye cannot see, the severity of their Oripathy is rapidly getting worse.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "At the current rate, a certain cohort is about to enter the decompensation stage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Decompensation?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once the extent of the damage exceeds the body's maximum ability to compensate, the fragile equilibrium is broken and the patient quickly lapses into the acute exacerbation stage of Oripathy, where their condition deteriorates sharply and becomes life-threatening.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Actually, there are already people starting to enter the acute stage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_482_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "I get the gist of what you're talking about, but what does this have to do with\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait, are you saying that Kreide is at risk too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That isn't the problem. Based on an analysis of our findings so... You and Kreide seem to be the primary factors behind this occurrence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kreide and I caused all of this?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's complete nonsense!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "After analyzing your activities and movements, I've confirmed that you... or maybe something you're carrying, is strongly correlated with the incidence of false recovery.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "For example, the worker in the laundromat beside your residence said the day before that she 'felt especially good.' Her condition worsened dramatically last night, and she was nearly taken to hospice care.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I urge the two of you to cooperate with me. If you have any leads, please let me know right away! This is for the safety of everyone in the Afterglow!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_482_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz & Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can't think of anything at all?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing's coming to mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can the two of you come down to the office with me and let me check something real quick, just in case?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
