        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hibiscus, this time, it's the owner of a music shop behind Afterglow Hall!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andante"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2013\u2013How's the situation?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thankfully, he signed an agreement with the hospital in the Cliffy Patio, and has already been picked up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andante"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Another case of false recovery?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. Just yesterday afternoon, he reported 'no discomfort whatsoever.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andante"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll go follow up, just to make sure the hospital doesn't find a way to renege on the agreement.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andante"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Those two...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andante"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll handle it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_501_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I'll be off!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Andante"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
