    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have to ask again, is there anything you can think of?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Every moment is the difference between life and death, so please!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How about this. Ebenholz, why don't you come with me first? Let's have a chat about this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kreide, would you mind waiting a bit inside?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
