    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why'd you drag me out here by myself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I apologize in advance if this comes off the wrong way, but...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I want you and Kreide to keep some distance from each other. The sooner, the better.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you telling me this, and not him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#11$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you suspect that I purposely caused this so-called 'false recovery?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If only it were that simple, I'd be able to hand you straight to the Vyseheim authorities and that'd solve the root of the issue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But the incidents of false recovery started before you arrived, and Andante was the one who noticed. Otherwise, I wouldn't have come to the Afterglow, or even to Vyseheim.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then why did you say that\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Before I came? What about Kreide?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The phenomenon of false recovery... began right after he arrived in Vyseheim.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "After he arrived in Vyseheim...? How could that be?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#7$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It was at roughly the same time Kreide arrived in the Afterglow. The indicators from a portion of the Infected here began to gradually improve.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But his effect on the Infected was so miniscule at the time that nobody else noticed except the thorough and careful Andante.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "After the two of you met at the registration, Kreide's influence suddenly strengthened.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Based on the reports Andante submitted to the Rhodes Island landship, the situation would've taken at least half a year to deteriorate to its current state with just Kreide alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "After you arrived, in just a few days' time... We have the current situation on our hands.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I need you to explain to me what exactly is going on here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If you don't have an explanation, I'll need you to put things on hold before the situation spins out of control.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So, I hope you'll leave the Afterglow, and Vyseheim, as quickly as possible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What about the concert?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "The concert? That's what matters to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If the false recovery is caused by some sort of Arts, then your ensemble would amplify that, if anything\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait... Could it be, that's your...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#5$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be frank. I hate nothing more than being unfairly accused.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This isn't a problem that can be resolved by respecting your feelings!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I know!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So, give me some time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How long do you need?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#9$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If things go smoothly, just a few hours. If not...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I don't know. But I promise I'll be back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "name2": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, I'll trust you this once.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
