    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_482_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I don't agree to this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_482_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ebenholz worked so hard to perform in the concert, and finally managed to win over Herr Czerny... It'd be a travesty if he just walked away at this point!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're missing the bigger picture! We're talking about peoples' lives here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_482_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1024_hbisc2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ebenholz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hibiscus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_482_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ebenholz, where are you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_482_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ebenholz!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kreide"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.2,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_ltroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "fadetime": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You look like you're all out of breath. Did you run the entire way here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd urge you not to seek me out in this manner. The risk of being exposed is\u2013\u2013",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Exposed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Things are starting to go pear-shaped, and that's what you're worried about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to ask you something. Does the Resonanz from your so-called Voice of Mundane have any effect on other people?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The Resonanz? No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as it is not deliberately directed, the Voice of Mundane's Resonanz should not affect others in any way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Then why did Hibiscus see me and Kreide as the source of the false recoveries?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hibiscus?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "A Rhodes Island operator dispatched to Vyseheim.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So Rhodes Island has termed this phenomenon 'false recovery?' A clear and concise description, as you would expect of such professionals.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You... knew about it after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you're talking about the anomalies that have been happening to the Infected in the Afterglow recently, then yes, I do know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What exactly is going on?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Stated simply, the Voice of Mundane within Kreide is damaged.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Damaged???",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "When you cast Arts, the Voice of Mundane inside you will activate, therefore assisting you. Correct?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I do hear a faint, shrill melody as I'm casting Arts. How can something like that be damaged?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Kreide's Voice of Mundane has always been in an active state, unlike how you are able to turn yours off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "In other words, he's been unconsciously casting Arts all around him, with no ability to control it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you ask him, he'd probably tell you that he's always been able to hear some sort of vague melody in his head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You can understand this phenomenon as 'leakage.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#12$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This 'false recovery' is a product of the Voice of Mundane's leakage \u2013 indiscriminately increasing the activity of Originium in the surroundings, using the power of Originium to 'heal' the nearby Infected...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#12$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "However, the source of healing energy is taken directly from the Originium within the body of each Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#12$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Using the Infected themselves as Arts devices, using the Originium inside their bodies to enhance their compensatory functions... This is the 'false recovery' caused by Kreide's Voice of Mundane.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Kreide has been in this state for a long, long time, continuously affecting the Infected around him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If this has been going on for so long, someone should've figured it out by now!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The credit for that goes to you, Herr Ebenholz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Me?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#3$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Resonanz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Resonanz amplifies the leakage of Kreide's Voice of Mundane, which is causing an explosion in the recent cases of false recovery?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's the situation, yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#2$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, I see exactly what's going on now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I hereby withdraw from your plan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Freedom is at your fingertips, and you're going to give it up just like that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not crazy enough to buy my freedom with the lives of an entire swath of Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You've been shaken by that woman from Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This false recovery is indeed not a good thing, but your concert with Kreide is just a few days away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "After a few days, your Voice of Mundane will be removed, and then you'll leave Vyseheim. Nobody will even notice that we're short of a few Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. If you walk away now, Graf Urtica's shadow will follow you your entire life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#8$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that what you really want?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#5$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No, but I won't do that either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Goodbye, Dame Gertrude.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gertrude"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_484_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_4046_ebnhlz_1#1$2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "None of your business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ebenholz"
    },
